    <article class="project-narrative">
      <div class="project-overview" data-scroll-group data-scroll-step="80">
        <p class="lede">At PwC, I worked on an AI platform for IT support teams, where a simple request can leave someone with quite a lot to do. Giving a colleague access to a workspace means finding the right account and changing its permissions. Helping with a broken application may mean searching through documentation before knowing what to try.</p>
        <p>I built two parts of the platform to help with this work. <strong>Knowledge Management</strong> finds and maintains the material used by the question-answering assistant. <strong>Browser Control</strong> lets an operator hand a ticket to an AI agent that works through the application in their browser.</p>
